   2:Source/render/image_decoder.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — image_decoder.c
   3:Source/render/image_decoder.c ****  * Port of Source/render/image_decoder.lua (reference, 308 lines).
   4:Source/render/image_decoder.c ****  *
