 297:Source/render/image_decoder.c ****      * NOTE: bodyLen is the BYTE length from the HTTP client — binary image
 298:Source/render/image_decoder.c ****      * bodies contain NUL bytes, so strlen() must never be used here (the
 299:Source/render/image_decoder.c ****      * pre-P33 build truncated every PNG/JPEG/GIF/WebP at its first NUL). */
